{"id":"bc3b7feadfdbd674","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-least-filter.md","title":"Least Filter","display":"df-least-filter — Least Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-least-filter","aliases":["93-df-least-filter"],"display":"df-least-filter — Least Filter","depends_on":["[[93-df-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-least-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-least-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-least-filter — Least Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\">\\(X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fil}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fil}\\)</span> (filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> (generated-filter operator defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}least\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|:F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\land X\\subseteq F\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}least\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|:F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\land X\\subseteq F\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}least\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\to\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\n\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(X\\subseteq F\\to\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\subseteq F)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}least\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\to\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\n\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(X\\subseteq F\\to\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\subseteq F)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The defining family is nonempty because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbf A|\">\\(|\\mathbf A|\\)</span> itself is a filter. Nonempty <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> guarantees that its intersection is nonempty even when the lattice has no greatest element.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fil}$ (filter predicate, see [[93-df-filter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fil}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}least\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{F\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|:F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\land X\\subseteq F\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}least\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathbf A\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\\varnothing\\neq X\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|\\to\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\n\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n(X\\subseteq F\\to\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}(X)\\subseteq F)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1222,"backlinks":[{"id":"b20ef7537d531bd9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fil}$ and $\\operatorname{FgFil}_{93}^{\\mathbf A}$ are the filter predicate and generated-filter constructor of [[93-df-filter]] and [[93-df-least-filter]]."}],"outgoing":["9beeac4373d773f8"]}